#. module: scheduler_error_mailer_futural_template
#: model:mail.template,body_html:scheduler_error_mailer_futural_template.scheduler_error_mailer
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: 'Lucida Grande', Ubuntu, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: #FFF; \" data-o-mail-quote-container=\"1\">\n"
"\n"
"<p>Odoo tried to run the scheduler <em><t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/></em> in the database <em><t t-out=\"ctx.get('dbname')\"/></em> but it failed. Here is the error message :</p>\n"
"\n"
"<strong>\n"
"<t t-out=\"ctx.get('job_exception') or 'Failed to get the error message from the context.'\"/>\n"
"</strong>\n"
"\n"
"<p>You may check the logs of the Odoo server to get more information about this failure.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Properties of the scheduler <em><t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/></em> :</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Model : <t t-out=\"object.model_id.name or ''\"/></li>\n"
"<li>Python code : <code><t t-out=\"object.code or ''\"/></code></li>\n"
"<li>Interval : <t t-out=\"object.interval_number or '0'\"/> <t t-out=\"object.interval_type or ''\"/></li>\n"
"<li>User : <t t-out=\"object.user_id.name or ''\"/></li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"\n"
"<p data-o-mail-quote=\"1\">\n"
"-- <br data-o-mail-quote=\"1\"/>\n"
"Automatic e-mail sent by Odoo. Do not reply.<br data-o-mail-quote=\"1\"/>\n"
"Database : <t t-out=\"ctx.get('dbname')\" data-o-mail-quote=\"1\"/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"    \n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: ‘Lucida Grande’, Ubuntu, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: #FFF; \" data-o-mail-quote-container=”1”>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Odoo yritti suorittaa ajastinta <em><t t-out=”object.name or ‘’”/></em> tietokannassa <em><t t-out=”ctx.get(‘dbname’)”/></em>, mutta se epäonnistui. Tässä on virheilmoitus:</p>\n"
"\n"
"<strong>\n"
"<t t-out=”ctx.get(‘job_exception’) or ‘Virheilmoitusta ei voitu hakea kontekstista.’”/>\n"
"</strong>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Voit tarkistaa Odoo-palvelimen lokit saadaksesi lisätietoja tästä virheestä.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Aikatauluttajan ominaisuudet <em><t t-out=”object.name or ‘’”/></em> :</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Malli : <t t-out=”object.model_id.name or ‘’”/></li>\n"
"<li>Python-koodi : <code><t t-out=”object.code or ‘’”/></code></li>\n"
"<li>Väli : <t t-out=”object.interval_number or ‘0’”/> <t t-out=”object.interval_type or ‘’”/></li>\n"
"<li>Käyttäjä : <t t-out=”object.user_id.name or ‘’”/></li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"\n"
"<p data-o-mail-quote=”1”>\n"
"-- <br data-o-mail-quote=”1”/>\n"
"Odoon lähettämä automaattinen sähköposti. Älä vastaa.<br data-o-mail-quote=”1”/>\n"
"Tietokanta: <t t-out=”ctx.get(‘dbname’)” data-o-mail-quote=”1”/>\n"
"</p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"    \n"
"        \n"
"    \n"
"        "

